{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >explanation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a JRPG set on an alien planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synopsis</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a story about a star in another world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A planet whose environment and ecology are different from our world. Living things live peacefully and in harmony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, something strange suddenly occurred on that planet. A mysterious disease spread, people have suddenly turned into monsters, and peaceful days were threatened. <br>Will the main characters, the birds, be able to solve the case?   <br>Experience the story of this planet with them while enjoying relaxing battles and mini-games. <br> <br>Battle <br>It's a classic turn-based battle. After setting it up, you can relax and watch the battle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini game<br>It's a rustic yet heartwarming Mini-game. <br>Press the switch to start the game. (Some games start without pressing the switch.) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bGame engine<br>Produced with SmileGameBuilder and RPGDeveloperBakin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bTrailers and screenshots are from the base application.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2829360?t=1769574707","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829360/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769574707","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829360/a96af34f531072cd85f5292dea7235ca0664d720/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769574707","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829360/a96af34f531072cd85f5292dea7235ca0664d720/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769574707","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2961690,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >explanation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a JRPG set on an alien planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synopsis</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a story about a star in another world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A planet whose environment and ecology are different from our world. Living things live peacefully and in harmony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, something strange suddenly occurred on that planet. A mysterious disease spread, people have suddenly turned into monsters, and peaceful days were threatened. <br>Will the main characters, the birds, be able to solve the case?   <br>Experience the story of this planet with them while enjoying relaxing battles and mini-games. <br> <br>Battle <br>It's a classic turn-based battle. After setting it up, you can relax and watch the battle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini game<br>It's a rustic yet heartwarming Mini-game. <br>Press the switch to start the game. (Some games start without pressing the switch.) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bGame engine<br>Produced with SmileGameBuilder and RPGDeveloperBakin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bTrailers and screenshots are from the base application.</p>","developers":["Kaburanegi"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829360/header.jpg?t=1769574707","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<st